            <history xml:id="history_idcc8ac7f7">
               <p xml:id="idm88">The piece was written for the silver wedding of the industrialist and art collector Heinrich Hirschsprung (1836-1908) and his wife Pauline Elisabeth, née Jacobson (1845-1912) on 29 June 1889. Gade not only quotes his own Bridal Waltz from the ballet "Et Folkesagn", but also incorporates his own musical signature G - A  - D - E</p>
